"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_ORTADOGU:1250-04-07:0":{"b": ["Mansura: the Muslims decisively defeated the Crusader army of Louis IX", "8d1db119"], "d": ["In the battles that lasted from the beginning of March to 7 April 1250, the Crusaders were decisively defeated; the king and his entourage were to be released in return for the restitution of Damietta and a heavy ransom.", "4c176422"]},
"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_ORTADOGU:1250-05-07:0":{"b": ["Damietta was returned to the Muslims", "f7070829"], "d": ["In return for the release of the king, Damietta was surrendered to the Muslims on 7 May 1250.", "16c1ec7a"]},
