"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_ORTADOGU:1291-07-01:0":{"b": ["Sidon passed to the Mamluks (the Templar knights withdrew)", "2339a488"], "d": ["On the conquest of Acre (690/1291), the Templar knights who left it took refuge in Sidon; the city fell into the hands of the Mamluks in Rajab 690 / July 1291, and its walls were demolished.", "4c9103e0"]},
